<ArticleLayout title="Cortisol Tracking Apps: iPhone, Apple Watch & Testing" description="Choosing a cortisol tracking app? Compare wearable stress tracking with hormone tests, see what Cortisol+ does on iPhone, and understand free versus paid options." published="2026-09-16" updated="2026-11-12">
