<h2>How often should I test cortisol?</h2>
<p><strong>There is no set testing schedule for everyone.</strong> It depends on why a doctor is testing and which method they use.</p>
<p>Repeated tests without a clear question can be hard to make sense of. Ongoing or worrying symptoms need a doctor's check, not repeated app checks.</p>

